      "name": "Mauling Rush",
      "actions": 2,
      "traits": [],
      "description": "<p>The gliding bear Strides up to double its Speed in a straight line, Climbing and Leaping over any obstacles in its way. At the end of this movement, it can attempt a melee Strike. On a hit, it additionally knocks the target Prone.</p>",
      "collapsed": false
